{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（29日）下午1時32分，粉嶺公路往上水方向近康樂園，有貨車與垃圾車相撞。據報，貨車司機及乘客一度被困。救援人員到場後，當中一人由救護車送往北區醫院治理。</p><p>運輸署宣佈，因交通意外，粉嶺公路（往上水方向）近泰亨的部份行車線現已封閉。駕駛人士只可使用餘下行車線行車，現時上址交通繁忙。</p><figure><img alt=\"據報，貨車司機及乘客一度被困。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Brutus Ko圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192484609556877312150478.png/Fb7znk57i8gy67-g2yXN1mjoaclf8fv5tvTIfLb0yHw\"/><figcaption>據報，貨車司機及乘客一度被困。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Brutus Ko圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"粉嶺公路往上水方向近康樂園，一輛垃圾車及貨車發生碰撞。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Brutus Ko圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192484607333765120547068.png/iE8AqFrZbIHvNgiJZc1hFkX3mAOVeR6UwKQCFcCkAhU\"/><figcaption>粉嶺公路往上水方向近康樂園，一輛垃圾車及貨車發生碰撞。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Brutus Ko圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>由網上車cam可見，貨車疑收掣不及撞上前面的垃圾車。而前方另有一輛客貨車停在路中，車尾玻璃甩脫，未知是否與事件有關。</p><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Brutus Ko圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192484611679326208810279.png/tUGA9P1ygIolNlUU0f4w_8D_O0anj5Ynw5vC-cObwvk\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Brutus Ko圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批救援人員到場。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Brutus Ko）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192484758400012288324076.png/GrckCnN5pSJb0mnLjhBpYtetMWPCDHq6whs8fcIbPH0\"/><figcaption>大批救援人員到場。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Brutus Ko）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批救援人員到場。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Brutus Ko）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192484760677650432358914.png/2gfhaBflFfrr341fb7H7gxoVl_HllkLaBKkksgSpJLI\"/><figcaption>大批救援人員到場。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Brutus Ko）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批救援人員到場。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Brutus Ko）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192484762988843008579204.png/RCGimocrhwouPMM95I3RUQGLWP1Sh9piYorjt2KK47c\"/><figcaption>大批救援人員到場。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Brutus Ko）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貨車收掣不及撞上垃圾車。（Facebook車cam截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192490756896460800167590.jpeg/lgQCq6GAz4uULBMGiyoFg3NLsaBJ6hkFxuoVe8bqFXs\"/><figcaption>貨車收掣不及撞上垃圾車。（Facebook車cam截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貨車收掣不及撞上垃圾車。（Facebook車cam截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192490759106990080702456.jpeg/LgBct6EhLQnqcASu2hszzDKndU7KHkP5aUS-kmlEvpI\"/><figcaption>貨車收掣不及撞上垃圾車。（Facebook車cam截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一輛客貨車車尾損毀停在路中。（Facebook車cam截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192490761309130752712459.jpeg/AxGvDsJ-vmMS4H8X7sYAYMMMl4x34PJA-fWAh_n1gIc\"/><figcaption>一輛客貨車車尾損毀停在路中。（Facebook車cam截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一輛客貨車車尾損毀停在路中。（Facebook車cam截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192490763460939776375601.jpeg/05fuUdkxi7kTx8VUh-Doa9Ss47rpeUR25PwfEOT8HxA\"/><figcaption>一輛客貨車車尾損毀停在路中。（Facebook車cam截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:22:16.721410+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":565,"images":10,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:39:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T09:38:45.184992+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:38.449508+00:00","content_hash":"ee0fd814dc1fcfa847ad1f9c94ba4fd7397014a0431534ed9762db8b05609980","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}